# Magus of the Moon's ruling: "If Magus of the Moon loses its abilities, it continues to turn nonbasic lands into
# Mountains", because its layer-4 effect applies before the layer-6 effect that takes its abilities (CR 613.1, 613.6). On turn
# 2 Bot2 enchants Magus with Eaten by Piranhas: Magus is a black 1/1 Skeleton with no abilities. On turn 3
# Bot1's Mutavault is still a Mountain, with no "{1}" or "{T}: Add {C}", tapping for {R}; and an Azorius Chancery played
# then is judged as it would exist on the battlefield, a Mountain (CR 614.12): it enters untapped and its trigger does not
# go on the stack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mutavault
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Magus of the Moon
Azorius Chancery
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Eaten by Piranhas
Island x17

